{"id":"c04baacf4202d9f7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-complete-system.md","title":"Complete System","display":"df-complete-system — Complete System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-complete-system","aliases":["92-df-complete-system"],"display":"df-complete-system — Complete System","depends_on":["[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-complete-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-complete-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete-system — Complete System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash\\varphi\\lor G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash\\varphi\\lor G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : 系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>是完备的</li>\n<li>完备系统对每个句子都能证明其本身或否定</li>\n<li>这里定义的是理论的句法（否定）完备性，不是“一阶逻辑证明演算对语义后承完备”这一元定理</li>\n<li>Gödel第一不完备性定理只对满足有效可公理化、足够算术强度与相容性等条件的系统推出这种不完备性，并非对<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的任意扩展无条件成立</li>\n<li>若系统还相容且其定理可有效枚举，则可并行搜索<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>的证明，从而决定每个句子；没有有效性条件时，句法完备本身不提供算法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentence set, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash$ (provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}complete\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Complete}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;(G\\vdash\\varphi\\lor G\\vdash\\neg\\varphi)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal{F})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1341,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]"},{"id":"ea730faf0a9f37d4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38545b094b915076","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9f1d74ed907c53b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"52184c84df392b80","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Complete}$ (completeness predicate, see [[92-df-complete-system]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-complete-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[9